  lex_comments_err_nested.pcpp - Lexical: block comments do not nest

  Break step of lex_comments: a slash-star inside a block comment is only
  text, so the first star-slash closes the comment. It is LX0203, a
  warning: the module still builds.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_comments_err_nested;

/*
  @@test
    kind build
  @@end
*/

begin
  /* outer /* inner */ // WARN LX0203@12: '/*' within block comment
end.
